Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 01:22:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 419/488] [DS4.1] The logits rows' inputs gathered once a step,
 in TileLang

input_ids[logits_indices] and positions[logits_indices] were gathered
with torch up to four times a step: by the rejection sampler (or the
sampler), the all-greedy verification's sink cut and the sink policy.
InputBatch.logits_rows() gathers both in one TileLang launch the first
time a step asks and every reader shares the result. Tested against
torch's indexing, repeated and negative indices included.
